    {
      "subId": "7012107",
      "subQuestName": "Give the gathered journals to Stevens",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701210301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701210301": {
            "id": "701210301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About those journals...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210302"
            ]
          },
          "701210302": {
            "id": "701210302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "You found the rest of them? Amazing! Here, let me take a look...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210303"
            ]
          },
          "701210303": {
            "id": "701210303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Hmm... Wow, my goodness... Wait, if this detail is correct...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210304"
            ]
          },
          "701210304": {
            "id": "701210304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What have you found out?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210305"
            ]
          },
          "701210305": {
            "id": "701210305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Oh, uh... Sorry, I was lost in thought. Ahem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210306"
            ]
          },
          "701210306": {
            "id": "701210306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Thank you, these investigation journals are of rather significant historical value. There is a serious dearth of detail on this topic in the existing literature, as all the available sources only make passing reference to some mysterious investigation team formed once by the aristocrats...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210307"
            ]
          },
          "701210307": {
            "id": "701210307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "These journals you found will help fill in some major gaps in the historical record.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210308"
            ]
          },
          "701210308": {
            "id": "701210308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Now, we finally have answers to the questions of why so little information on the investigation appears elsewhere — and why nothing of relevance beyond the initial departure of the team is recorded in the annals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210309"
            ]
          },
          "701210309": {
            "id": "701210309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think I understand what happened, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210310"
            ]
          },
          "701210310": {
            "id": "701210310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Yes, well... Although there are still a fair few minor details to straighten out, the overall picture is becoming very clear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210311"
            ]
          },
          "701210311": {
            "id": "701210311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Paimon doesn't get it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210312"
            ]
          },
          "701210312": {
            "id": "701210312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Well, all the evidence — or lack thereof — would suggest that not one member of the investigation returned to Mondstadt. But, these journals suggest there's a chance that one of them, called Eberhart, may have managed to escape...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210313"
            ]
          },
          "701210313": {
            "id": "701210313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Since there is no record of his return in Mondstadt, however... The million-Mora question is: Where did he go?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210314"
            ]
          },
          "701210314": {
            "id": "701210314",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Many other details need corroborating, too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210315"
            ]
          },
          "701210315": {
            "id": "701210315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "But without a doubt, this doesn't detract from how valuable these are as historical sources.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210316"
            ]
          },
          "701210316": {
            "id": "701210316",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "I am most grateful to you. Please take this for your trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210317"
            ]
          },
          "701210317": {
            "id": "701210317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Any other books you find while out exploring the mountains, I'd be much obliged if you could bring them to me on your return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701210318"
            ]
          },
          "701210318": {
            "id": "701210318",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stevens",
            "text": "Eberhart... Where did you go..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}